{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:258","content":{"id":258,"title":"40 自身免疫性疾病","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e3c88b58-85d0-4086-9c5d-a9d6eca7f3c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"免疫系统对自身免疫非常小心，只有能区分自身和异物的细胞才能离开胸腺。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9fb999c0-5d56-45ba-9562-c515d5685bf4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自身免疫正常的情况下，T 细胞和 B 细胞可以识别自体细胞的蛋白（自身抗原）。一旦受到误导，T 细胞和 B 细胞和自身抗原结合，免疫系统不能区分自身和异物，麻烦就大了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"390aff97-fec9-4957-8fec-fcb9fa273788","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么情况下会发生这种情况，满足以下条件："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2161c14e-bc26-4077-8b22-4539cfa1f67f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f449585d-dd0c-42ff-a70a-eb4d6bb67b08","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e29ef345-3270-46f5-9d01-5664c4692307","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MHC 分子能和自身抗原结合，由遗传决定"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ec803134-7693-4760-b3e4-ffba59ef70c4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"05546632-85d2-435f-b808-d2386bff9548","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"身体能生成可以识别自身抗原的 T 细胞和 B 细胞，且这些细胞不被身体杀死"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bb2cb46b-41d5-4a22-bdfa-31fe5d77cb9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自身免疫性疾病的可能的发生步骤："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"08ddce95-faa4-41ac-8568-b0f6eda61cd0","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6f0f4d3e-3bad-4ada-92ce-e6d854f3439c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c80f13fe-52c4-424e-b6d4-3c4ea82bf3fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有遗传易感性（非必需）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"79e25049-ab72-49fb-a32a-c41df1dcaf52","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dd1f4e31-ce2c-431b-ba06-3d2b18422b6f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"体内能生成可以识别自身抗原的 B 细胞和 T 细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"361ff819-05af-4ec8-98e8-ea7cbfe54afc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f5fccbd-d98c-4ec5-a01f-2fe7564016ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人体有感染，刺激先天性免疫系统激活上述 B 细胞和 T 细胞"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"663208b3-bfa3-4d55-a578-13c84bbeb965","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"具体怎么引发的，还不完全清楚，有一个流行的理论，分子相似，是指微生物的抗原和体细胞抗原很相似。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cca84461-6c99-49a7-8a27-f8d6ece287e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个 T 细胞和 B 细胞都能识别某一特定抗原的受体，实际上每个 T 细胞和 B 的受体识别的范围要更宽一些，也能和其他一些抗原结合，例如 B 细胞受体出了可以识别某种特定抗原，还能识别另外八种相似，但不完全相同的抗原。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3b7342e6-2688-4c72-9070-bdb9660c0b53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果病原体它带有的抗原类似于某种自身抗原，就会导致激活适应性免疫系统，凑巧适应性细胞也能和自身抗原结合，那就麻烦了。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"3df629ea-d267-4abf-9012-f5c9b55641e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3dfdd372-7cee-438c-abd1-3c167198d51b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无反应性，一种巧妙的抑制策略，可以抑制自身反应性 T 细胞。树突状细胞不仅仅是在战场上采样，其实抑制处于采样模式，所以可以预料到其中有很多自身抗原，通过于自身性 T 细胞结合，但是不释放激活信号，T 细胞随后会自行失活。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第四部分 反叛与内战"},{"label":"40 自身免疫性疾病","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:258","type":"doc","id":258}}],"prevPage":{"title":"39 免疫系统可能想念寄生虫","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:257","type":"doc","id":257}},"nextPage":{"title":"41 卫生假说和老朋友","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:259","type":"doc","id":259}},"createTime":1741912905099,"updateTime":1743303640538,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640538}}